  "description": "Provider-neutral .NET library for OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, xAI Grok, DeepSeek, and Perplexity. Provides text and multimodal completions, controllable runs with streaming and cancellation, GPT-6 Astra steering and opt-in asynchronous tools, common reasoning and hosted search with citations, structured output, token usage, context recovery, ordered function-call batches, and optional OpenAI/Gemini image generation and editing. Feature support is validated per provider and model. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 3.1.0. Targets .NET Standard 2.1.",
