  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v7.1.0 adds GPT-6 Astra, StartRunAsync with result/stream/cancellation and supported steering, opt-in native asynchronous tools, and common reasoning, hosted search, and citations. Preserves accepted cache-aware reasoning changes and rolls back failed changes. Legacy Agent methods now warn; existing completion and streaming APIs remain supported. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 3.1.0. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v710",
